## Interface: 16001
## Title: CraftPath
## Notes: The cheapest way to level a profession: a route to your target skill, a shopping list with Buy buttons, and a Craft next button that always picks the right recipe. Requires CraftProfit. Open from the book button in the profession window or /cpath.
